@startuml ML_Training_Pipeline
title TokerBank AI Fraud Shield - MLOps & Training Pipeline

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica", "Arial", sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #2C3E50
skinparam ArrowColor #34495E

|1. Data Engineering|
start
:Aggregate Transaction Data\n(from PostgreSQL);
:Generate 18-Feature Vector;
:Address Class Imbalance\n(Legitimate vs. Fraud);

|2. Data Partitioning|
:Partition Dataset into 3 Isolated Sets;
split
   :Training Set (70%)\n(Used for learning);
split again
   :Validation Set (15%)\n(Hyperparameter tuning);
split again
   :Hold-out Test Set (15%)\n(Unbiased evaluation);
end split

|3. Dual-Algorithm Training|
fork
    :Isolation Forest (Unsupervised)\nDetects Zero-Day Anomalies;
fork again
    :XGBoost (Supervised)\nClassifies Known Fraud Patterns\n(using 'scale_pos_weight');
end fork

|4. Evaluation & Explainability|
:Evaluate Metrics on Hold-out Test Set\n(Accuracy, AUC-ROC, F1-Score);
:Generate SHAP Explanations\n(Feature Importance Analysis);

|5. Deployment (MLOps)|
:Convert Python Models to ONNX Format;
:Generate Metadata JSON\n(Version, Thresholds, SHAP base values);
:Zero-Downtime Hot-load into\nJava Spring Boot Engine;
stop

@enduml
